<main class="grid min-h-screen place-items-center bg-slate-50 px-6 py-12">
  <div class="w-full max-w-3xl text-center">
    <nav class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-end gap-3 text-sm">
      <% if user_signed_in? %>
        <span class="text-slate-600">
          <%= current_user.email %>
        </span>

        <%= button_to "로그아웃",
              destroy_user_session_path,
              method: :delete,
              class: "rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-white hover:bg-slate-
              700" %>
      <% else %>
        <%= link_to "로그인",
              new_user_session_path,
              class: "font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900" %>

        <%= link_to "회원가입",
              new_user_registration_path,
              class: "rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-white hover:bg-
              indigo-500" %>
      <% end %>
    </nav>

    <header class="mb-10">
      <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600">
        HJMemo
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
        기억하고 싶은 내용을 꾸준히 복습하세요
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">
        질문과 답변으로 메모를 만들면 적절한 시점에 다시 보여드립니다.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">
        오늘의 복습
      </p>

      <p class="mt-2 text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900">
        0
      </p>

      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
        아직 복습할 메모가 없습니다.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
